    "body": "<p>xx</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HDRRC7PFW05HBXMEA4EMXPV6\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to change your account name (also called your organization name) in Klaviyo. Knowing how to do this is helpful if your company is rebranding, there’s a mistake in the current name, or you simply want to edit it in some way. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HDRRC7PFB91RX51XTNNVFSDB\">Before you begin</h2>\n<p>Please note the following: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>You must be an Owner or Admin to edit the account’s name.</li>\n<li>If you use a branded sender ID to send SMS, you may also want to change that ID. \n<ul>\n<li>In Australia, you will also need to <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/14953787622427\">register the new branded sender ID</a>. </li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HDRRC7PF99YGQ7D4MKPD2QAQ\">Change account name in Klaviyo</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Click the current account name in the bottom left corner. </li>\n<li>Select <strong>Settings</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28723545985179\" alt=\"Account dropdown in bottom left when Settings is highighted\">\n</li>\n<li>Under <em>Account</em>, choose <strong>Organization</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28723545991835\" alt=\"Organization tab under Account Settings\">\n</li>\n<li>Review and, if needed, edit the <em>Default sender name</em>. </li>\n<li>Under <em>Company/organization name</em>, input your desired account name. Here, we changed “Bridge Designs” to “Designs by Bridge” and also updated the sender name.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28723545990043\" alt=\"Organization tab, showing where to change the company name, sender name, and more\">\n</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Save</strong>. </li>\n<li>Refresh the page or click into a new tab to see your new account name.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28723524059931\" alt=\"Account dropdown showing the new organization name\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HDRRC7PG21NBMEX8B7G78PW5\">Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360047183572\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to rebrand in Klaviyo</a></li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360035285472\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Understanding your SMS settings</a><br><br>\n</li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
